			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "How it Works: \n 1. It pick two random point in the aperture\n 2. Basically Server S4 and S5\n 3. S4 has more chances to get picked because of 3/7 then 2/7\n 4. check health status also\n 5. Compare Weighted Loads\n  \n",
